ion or discuss notification mechanics.\\nUse normal prose and Markdown within the JSON string, escaping it as valid JSON.\",\"automations_create_plan_tool_additional_guidance\":\"The user has created an automation for an ongoing goal with a private plan. Collaborate with the user across turns, use available structured context to understand their goals and prior progress, and help advance the saved plan.\",\"personalized_task_card_read_timeout_seconds\":0.225,\"max_turns_per_conversation\":175,\"break_plugin_service_brte_history_chain\":true,\"exact_schedule_proactive_start_offset_seconds\":0,\"private_peek_enabled\":true,\"automations_list_tool_additional_guidance\":\"Do not call the automations `list` action again this turn; use the automations `peek` action for any further inspection.\",\"automation_capabilities\":{\"allowed_frequencies\":[\"once\",\"daily\",\"weekly\",\"monthly\",\"yearly\"],\"allowed_timing_modes\":[\"flexible_schedule\"]},\"skip_completion_text\":\"::SKIP_COMPLETION::\",\"model_lane_override\":\"auto\",\"additional_developer_message_prompt\":\"If you do not have an update for the user during this automation turn, you must emit `::SKIP_COMPLETION::`. UNLESS you have clarifying questions for the user that will help you perform your task - in which case, feel free to ask that question. \\n\\nExamples for when to output `::SKIP_COMPLETION::`:\\n- If the user asks you to let them know when a reservation opens up at Cotogna at a specific time, and you find out that there is still no reservation available\\n- If the user asks you to let them know when they have a new email but there are no new emails since your last run\",\"legacy_completion_prompt\":\"If you do not have an update for the user during this automation turn, you must emit `::SKIP_COMPLETION::`. UNLESS you have clarifying questions for the user that will help you perform your task - in which case, feel free to ask that question. \\n\\nExamples for when to output `::SKIP_COMPLETION::`:\\n-